{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793204486,"nonce":"lqhtE5PAdrn+0X8CbeuBRsZW5sg=","title":"Keep app previews visible while hover tooltips are open","message":"The app preview hides its iframe for every Ashui TopLayer entry. Hovering the preview tab's Close control therefore blanks the whole app, although the tooltip is outside the app viewport.\n\nKeep ordinary tooltip overlays from hiding the frame. If a tooltip overlaps it, expose only that region so the canvas tooltip draws above the app and pointer hit testing stays correct. Preserve full overlay behavior for dialogs, menus, command center and sheets. Verify tooltip enter/leave, overlapping clips, retained iframe/application state, and the actual embedded editor, then rebuild WASM/session and restart local services.","files":null}]}